---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services | Incentric CX"
  description="Explore Incentric services for customer experience strategy, service design, and growth improvement."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 px-6 py-24 text-slate-900">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue hover:underline">Back to home</a>
      <section class="mt-8 border-b border-slate-200 pb-10">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-brand-blue">Services</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">
          Customer experience services for measurable growth.
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          We help diagnose customer issues, design better experiences, and guide implementation across service, CRM, and growth systems.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue">01</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold">Business & Customer Diagnosis</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Identify customer pain points, operational blind spots, and priority improvements.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue">02</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold">Strategy & Experience Design</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Shape customer strategies, journeys, and service standards that teams can execute.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue">03</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-bold">Implementation & Growth Improvement</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            Turn strategy into measurable service quality, loyalty, and sustainable business growth.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
